  "instructions": [
    "In a large saucepan, combine the beets, onion, horseradish, sugar, chilli flakes, and vegetable broth. Simmer over medium heat for 20 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the yeast, room temperature water, and a pinch of sugar. Let sit for 5 minutes, allowing the yeast to activate.",
    "Add the yeast mixture to the saucepan and stir to combine. Simmer for an additional 10 minutes, or until the soup has thickened slightly.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "To serve, ladle the soup into a bamboo tray and garnish with a sprinkle of wheat shojin bread crumbs, if desired.",
    "Use the whisk as a garnish or a utensil to eat the soup."
